config PINCTRL_TCC803X
	bool "Telechips TCC803x pin controller driver"
	depends on ARCH_TCC803X || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	select PINMUX
	default ARCH_TCC803X
	help
	  Pin controller and GPIO driver for the Telechips TCC803x SoC.
	  Covers only pin banks GPA..GPSD1 (see the driver for why); does
	  not yet implement pin bias/drive-strength/slew-rate (pinconf).
